{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f435f79d45fb121d4f2b3c59b7f3b6a63d411b729de489ed768ad74b2ff7cbe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f95e175010e73956089568a0d2417e52f21367c54fd9c404a14402e29213909",
      "text": "（呼……今天的课程真严酷啊。\n明天也还有，回家早点睡吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a7536fc32d302e460cd0702e7055406fa84a1bc602708773f0af539eb6ad16",
      "text": "（但是，今天有哪怕熬夜也想玩通关的游戏……\n稍微去趟事务所马上就回家吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708111400c446d3d3720bd8ae11ca740967134854c71726b78ab33aeccff3da5",
      "text": "我去拿咖啡来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a65383691e41026f9ae7f9a083c456ca4f15fd02cf74d98f8a5eb5f3fd6ab71e",
      "text": "嗯？皮埃尔的声音？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ad91b0dbf38a3ccfa415e701800812f9b84f8a7c2fba6ab8e5c88afc519412",
      "text": "啊，恭二！\n辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:930fb93261308a7ae191e6caae56acf9ccd0d673231d13e9f61dabcd205c0040",
      "text": "哦……皮埃尔也还在工作吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d4c14e5852d95b1b0265c1570b071636516dc0ca45f581d58802d1b5ec81a1a",
      "text": "不是，在准备恭二的派对哦。\n实也在一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e68bee69cbc82e6d0d9b6c9f1f4c9596d1272c2c310045c381f851275411eeb",
      "text": "我的？\n这样啊……喂，我也来帮忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb9c7aff2ad90b1229252ef40b739cdc6b103f1e56fc1660dc2b2b3b90a0667",
      "text": "不行。恭二，是派对的主宾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d5fd68f519d8be7af90a056d60c46a2277bc06f58c789cc0cdded067e40bc01",
      "text": "咦，我还以为听到恭二的声音了呢……\n辛苦啦。看起来今天相当拼命了呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e7a38d6eeb6b50446ff13d9c7cd38666a09edac64ee3df8648e989b0b150b00",
      "text": "今天就快去休息吧。就像皮埃尔说的那样，\n我们希望恭二能满怀期待地迎来当天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff8fa1fe8d6a88b376ea6b52a5903c9f5333d59f9e0ceea07ce10391aebd2d6",
      "text": "这、样啊……谢谢你们。\n不过，你们两个也别太勉强了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
